  "scenario": "destroy_not_found_settles_on_absent_observe",
  "summary": "A destroy of a resource the provider does not hold answers a bare not_found. Alone, that settles nothing: the worker looked once, now, in its own scope, and Fabric keeps the destroy unknown with the reason on its row and the replacement barrier up. Fabric then observes the destroy by its own operation and target; the worker's one read finds no resource and answers unknown/absent with the scope it searched, and Fabric settles the destroy succeeded with that evidence on the row and nothing residual. The same absent answer to an observe of a create whose answer was lost settles nothing: the create stays unknown with the searched scope stored. No provider call is made.",
